### Sibling loader dirs from the 1.20.1 branch (this is the NeoForge / main line) ###
# Forge/ and Fabric/ belong to the 1.20.1 branch. On main they only linger as
# empty / ignored shells after a `git switch` (git never deletes a directory or
# ignored files), so deleting them by hand never sticks across a round-trip.
# Ignore them outright here so git never tracks or surfaces anything under them.
# Branch-local: the 1.20.1 .gitignore is untouched, where they are real source.
/Forge/
/Fabric/
